wg-quic is an independent userspace VPN implementation with native-style
OPNsense instance, peer, endpoint generator, status, and dashboard interfaces.
It ships the wg-quic data plane and wg-quic-quick FreeBSD host-policy
supervisor. Its configuration, control sockets, interfaces, and Web UI stay
separate from the built-in WireGuard subsystem.

WWW: https://github.com/RC-CHN/wg-quic/tree/main/wg-quic-opnsense
